# Overlay applied on top of sdkconfig.defaults for the QEMU emulator build.
#
# The ESP-IDF QEMU machine does not emulate the Wi-Fi radio (starting it
# panics), so disable the radio. With it off, the firmware serves the same
# Wi-Fi configuration portal over the emulated OpenCores Ethernet interface,
# letting the configuration UI be exercised end to end in emulation.
#
# Build/run with:
#   idf.py -B build_qemu -DSDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS="sdkconfig.defaults;sdkconfig.qemu" build
#   idf.py -B build_qemu qemu
CONFIG_APP_ENABLE_WIFI_RADIO=n
